# --- Correspondence with collaborators -----------------------------------
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC. Letters, drafts, and any material that quotes
# private messages live here and are never committed. Added 2026-08-10 after
# an unsent draft reply (plus two decision.md files quoting Discord verbatim)
# was found staged for a push to the public remote.
correspondence/

# The rule above is a PATH, and a path only protects files that were put in it.
# On 2026-09-09 four DRAFT_REPLY_TO_TOM_*.md were written to tom_s3_spinor_toy/
# instead -- outside correspondence/, therefore not ignored, therefore committed
# (in 2b20d86 and c81c661) into this PUBLIC repo. Nothing was pushed; the four
# were removed from all 69 local commits by filter-branch and the originals now
# live in correspondence/. These name patterns close the gap the path left open:
# a letter is now ignored wherever in the tree it is written.
DRAFT_REPLY*
*REPLY_TO_TOM*
LETTER_TO_*
*_TO_TOM_*
